7a0a&_nc_ohc=nW--RnHXNEQQ7kNvwEaBee0&_nc_oc=AdrCpcHnQwG_XUUt6RPOiz0ZEmq8ov9f2ynLg9-BrxIeMl_Obomkire2v-KlASs4JBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9L9nufOz-m9prMztoKryH_fhVtW2NbcabRktfRZhMphA&oe=6A2982B2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "V7_1_2560x1440.png", "id": "4183663778611773", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_4183663781945106_4543292223308752591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ng3fCkmGBAwQ7kNvwH3OIfG&_nc_oc=AdrCwhN9NZ2_e_rJSsCXPga765tGTHhfEk95dFRrdRt23w4rEMfdwN10Ibvd1k41xjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ea4xkVi6KBcoicH9KH3EmTdghFBIqHp9cN70np9F3TQ&oe=6A2962DD"}, "display_name": "Brain Symphony: Relax & Wellbeing", "keywords": ["meditation", "relax", "calm", "focus", "stress"], "long_description": "**YOUR SPACE FOR CALM, BALANCE, AND FOCUS**\n\nTake a break from the noise, improve your mood, recharge your mind, and enjoy moments that help you feel calm, present, and at peace.Escape the pressure of everyday life, boost your mood and focus, and create moments of calm whenever you need them most.\n\n{1291283106512007}\n\n**YOUR SPACE TO RESET AND RECHARGE**\n\nDiscover immersive experiences designed to help you reduce stress, clear your mind, improve focus, and feel more balanced in everyday life.\n{989023497111419} \n\n\n**Inside the app, you can:** \n\n- Calm your mind with guided meditation in English, French, and German \n- Relax and express yourself through 2D and 3D painting \n- Release stress and boost your mood by singing along to music \n- Enjoy playful activities designed to help you unwind and reset mentally \n\n\n\n**\u25b6 Start your free trial today.** \n\n**Take a break. Relax your mind.**", "short_description": "Feel calmer, sleep deeper, reduce stress, and regain mental clarity through immersive experiences designed to help you relax and recharge. Improve focus, ease anxiety, support emotional balance, and reconnect with yourself while escaping the noise and pressure of everyday life. Whether you need a moment of peace, more energy, or a healthier state of mind, your reset starts here."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_1440x1440.png", "id": "27067176736252791", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_27067176749586123_491222076414574589_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ckhgL7NmTUIQ7kNvwHzgVzV&_nc_oc=Adqli8CzrE9mWKlnBkWcpdTGDmRJ4Tu4yB41kO5Ts4HxP5jpd0RarFosizTZ9NOkjAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_zPWIotw003qrIgFvQAzB1TgjoFAU8uM7Ld1Gc6tUfmw&oe=6A296541"}, {"file_name": "3000x900.png", "id": "26960735430233870", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_26960735453567201_1316494813454819529_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYCTZxxIiwUQ7kNvwG3KjJM&_nc_oc=AdpRWCsv9eg2zZUsEcLwGO28pX0AS1VEbnviJG5WOSA5JCLI5vCHwnt_UfZWSDzvXgc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-uvqGxKAYsPJmh_07MZvUSvNGYLkSZbD43CcLkF5zOOA&oe=6A2961F6"}, {"file_name": "V7_1008x1440.png", "id": "2464981333938754", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604338899_2464981340605420_4274724787803174214_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f5BAsWBjDw4Q7kNvwG3sjbM&_nc_oc=Adpo6CYotIXkjU6ClUmAeRZ08rXsTdUrMA7XTFjqIB2OY8iRpvyHbHm3L1NUaZRIrnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9kJ1bip9ove7tZP6JDBEQSxMtHcY2tKKNBjSyuP4IVZA&oe=6A29760C"}, {"file_name": "V7_1_2560x1440.png", "id": "1535968984532398", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_1535968987865731_190910078674909365_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I9QflqRZEXoQ7kNvwEPHY97&_nc_oc=Adocl4sxfjRUnbnEnpuQVRZdy3iQkXZAvZgFXYfAEpP6_5mtcm1